%% UC-05 — Manage profile (admin-defined field definitions)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (userProfileRouter)
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Open Profile screen
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/profile-field-definitions
    B->>M: find(profile_field_definitions)
    M-->>B: field definitions
    B-->>F: definitions (types, options, validation)
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/me/profile
    B->>M: findOne(profiles, {userId: sub})
    M-->>B: profile answers
    B-->>F: current answers
    P->>F: Edit answers, save
    F->>B: PUT /api/v1/me/profile {answers}
    B->>B: Validate against definitions
    B->>M: upsert(profiles, {userId})
    B-->>F: 200 updated profile
